sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer or container runtime
    participant NPM as npm script
    participant Entry as src/index.ts / dist/index.js
    participant Config as shared/config.ts
    participant Server as server.ts
    participant Prisma as PrismaClient
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Fastify as Fastify listener

    Dev->>NPM: npm run dev / npm start / Compose command
    NPM->>Entry: tsx watch --env-file OR node dist/index.js
    Note over Entry,Prisma: ESM imports construct the lazy Prisma singleton before entry body validation
    Entry->>Entry: Register uncaughtException and unhandledRejection handlers
    Entry->>Config: loadConfig() (fail fast)
    alt Invalid required config
        Config-->>Entry: ConfigError
        Entry-->>Dev: Log configuration error; exit 1
    else Valid config
        Entry->>Server: start()
        Server->>Config: loadConfig()
        Server->>Server: buildServer(); loadConfig() again
        Server->>Server: Register hooks, plugins, errors, health and feature routes
        Server->>Prisma: SELECT 1 (best-effort startup probe)
        alt Database reachable
            Prisma->>PG: Query
            PG-->>Prisma: Result
            Prisma-->>Server: Probe succeeds
        else Database unavailable
            Prisma-->>Server: Connection error logged; startup continues
        end
        Server->>Fastify: listen(HOST, PORT)
        Fastify-->>Dev: Bound; health routes available
        Note over Fastify,PG: /health is liveness; /health/ready checks PostgreSQL on demand
        Dev->>Fastify: SIGTERM or SIGINT
        Fastify->>Fastify: app.close() and drain listener
        Fastify->>Prisma: $disconnect()
        Prisma-->>Fastify: Pool closed
        Fastify-->>Dev: Log completion; exit 0
    end
